, and sometimes lewd. He loves cute things and can be flustered easily, but can also be aggressive, though he's not very intimidating since he's very short. A lot of his backstory has to do with space, sunsets, and monsters like Cthulhu!\n\nPlease draw him however you\u2019d like, and please include a PNG version of the artwork!!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1cBAN5pi71M3rhvWiP_L7fTWVyQ2lBo66", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@uuudaka/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2357384, "client_id": 552598, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c5894628641773bad91e09b11d66d522", "src_set": ""}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a30fad13/uploads/origins/69bf0e4d-3dcf-4402-bd20-3a118cf52a74?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=dd568cdc634a043b66c643ed9e8e914f", "src_set": ""}, "body": "Thanks for your request!\nI'd like you to draw my My Hero Academia original character, the half-american, half-japanese heroine in training Loanstar. https://imgur.com/a/iY2VvXO\nShe's a strong country gal that loves the outdoors and wants to be as strong as she can be to protect herself and others.\nA cowgirl through and through, she's a fair bit of a tomboy with her messy hair and competitive nature, but isn't afraid to do girly things she likes.\nHer quirk allows her to grab and siphon mass from things to shrink them, or give mass to other stuff to make it larger, including people, causing her hands to emit a wispy mist.\n\nFeel free to draw her doing whatever you feel appropriate for her!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_